{%- comment -%}
  Mobile baseline marker. Emits `cls` only when a size setting is still at its
  DEFAULT (i.e. the merchant hasn't customized it), so the mobile media query in
  theme.css resizes only untouched elements and leaves custom sizes alone.
  Params: val (current setting value), def (the schema default), cls (class to emit).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if val == def -%}{{ cls }}{%- endif -%}
